&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1840&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cc12485f6e6d&quot;&gt;Comfortable leading incident coordination, facilitating discussions, documenting decisions, and driving follow-up actions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1965&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d2a3dbf1f2c4&quot;&gt;Strong technical background that allows you to understand engineering discussions, infrastructure dependencies, and architectural trade-offs without being the primary implementer&lt;/p&gt;
