&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2456&quot; data-local-id=&quot;db6070ed6094&quot;&gt;Previous experience in high-growth infrastructure or platform engineering organisations where priorities change quickly and execution speed matters&lt;/p&gt;
